        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Alex Ebert\n- Organizations: Ima Robot, Of Montreal, Edward Sharpe and the Magnetic Zeros\n- Places: Los Angeles, California, Athens, Georgia\n- Products: The Early Four Track Recordings\n- Topics: bands, compilation albums\n\nFacts:\n- Ima Robot formed in the late 1990s and is a band based in Los Angeles, California.\n- Of Montreal is an American experimental pop band from Athens, Georgia.\n- Alex Ebert is best known as the lead singer and songwriter for Ima Robot and Edward Sharpe and the Magnetic Zeros.\n- The Early Four Track Recordings is a compilation album by the indie rock band Of Montreal.",
